# The private holdout: its seeds AND its generated cases. The amount literals in a
# holdout seeds file are the secret (a leaked amount is a memorisable gold answer),
# so neither the inputs nor the outputs may enter this public repo. Canonical home
# is the private Ethereum-dAI/local-llm-evals-holdout repo, one directory per
# version. tests/test_holdout_integrity.py fails if anything under here is tracked.
holdout/
